# The UNTDED ontology

Every element of the directory is published as linked data under the namespace https://www.untded.org/ns/untded#. The vocabulary — classes, properties, prefixes — is declared once in the dataset and everything on this page is generated from that declaration. Elements carry their representation as a structured node, their locations as bridge nodes (with line and position zones on the UN layout key), retired elements link to their replacement, and old names and business terms appear as alternative labels.

